Yaesu FT-710.</p><p><strong>FreeRig710:</strong> ESP32-P4 radio control, live video, browser audio and integrated FT8.</p><p><strong>Unified audio/PTT:</strong> the production GUI uses <code>/api/v1/audio/ws</code> for RX PCM, browser microphone PCM and latching PTT with a 1.5 s safety watchdog.</p><p><img class="video" src="/video.mjpeg" alt="Live HDMI video"></p><ul><li><a href="/video.mjpeg">/video.mjpeg</a> (live MJPEG)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/audio">/api/v1/hardware/audio</a> (RX + TX UAC1 status)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/cat">/api/v1/hardware/cat</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/radio/state">/api/v1/radio/state</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/usb">/api/v1/hardware/usb</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/health">/api/v1/health</a></li></ul></body></html>␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀фq@1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀рq@2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r@3␀␀␀␀␀␀␀и…@4␀␀␀␀␀␀Р@5␀␀␀␀␀␀$r@6␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r@7␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ДБ@8␀␀␀␀␀␀␀,r@9␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ls@A␀␀␀␀␀␀r@B␀␀␀␀␀␀Ђr@C␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r@D␀␀␀␀␀␀0®@E␀␀␀␀␀␀␀`s@F␀␀␀␀␀␀ёѓ@МБ@ФБ@ЬБ@дБ@мБ@|@фБ@ьБ@В@њѓ@В@В@|@В@$В@␀|@0␀␀␀,В@1␀␀␀8В@2␀␀␀DВ@3␀␀␀\В@4␀␀␀tВ@6␀␀␀ЊВ@7␀␀␀¤В@9␀␀␀јВ@A␀␀␀␀H␀ФВ@А3␀O␀ЬВ@@w␀Ђ„␀дВ@аg5␀␀	=␀мВ@ 5M␀)S␀рВ@АПj␀ co␀фВ@ љ␀pаљ␀шВ@ЂџХ␀°цЪ␀ьВ@ ІА8␀Г@@o@MGГ@ђК{0Q}Г@␀?« /ЕГ@ЂръЂщ7Г@Ђ,А_;Г@0123456789ABCDEF␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p—@␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀pЗ@␀␀␀␀␀␀™@␀␀␀␀␀␀T@␀␀␀␀␀ќМ@␀␀␀␀␀И™@␀␀␀␀␀␀рї␀␀␀␀␀␀р?␀␀␀␀␀:ў@␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀@333333у?љ™™™™™Щ?␀␀␀␀␀pз@␀␀␀␀␀LН@␀␀␀␀␀␀4@љ™™™™™й?␀␀␀␀␀@Џ@␀␀␀␀␀␀°<␀␀АяяяЯA␀␀␀␀␀␀аБяяяяяяп␀␀␀␀␀␀ш␀␀␀␀␀␀рНМММММММ␀␀␀␀␀аБб=UUUUХ?ЏВu=␀␀ В␀␀ЂїЧЈp?␀@F␀␀ AНМL>␀␀␀В␀␀ A␀юяF␀␀zD␀␀Ђ␀␀Ђ?␀Єё?pҐм6␀␀Ђ>␀␀␀?;Єё?␀␀ЂKBсS>U2l>Ј‹>«ЄЄ>·mЫ>љ™?␀␀@@␀@v?O8v?Ж#цё<Є83␀r1?r1?Њѕї5L»13кЭ5UіЉ8a6;«Є*>␀␀␀@␀␀␀L␀␀␀3␀␀ЂЂ␀␀Ђ␀яяяяяjpeg_del_encoder_engine␀s_cfg_desc␀␀s_jpeg_set_header_info␀␀jpeg_ll_sample_mode_select␀␀s_jpeg_enc_transaction_on_job_picked␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_check_intr_priority␀␀␀␀jpeg_acquire_code